URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/meschiya-lake-and-the-mood-swingers-2
 /
SUMMARY:Meschiya Lake and the Mood Swingers
DESCRIPTION:\nPrepare for an unforgettable evening as Meschiya Lake and the
  Mood Swingers make their debut at Jack of the Wood on August 24th\, 2024!
  From 9pm to midnight\, experience the soulful sounds of this celebrated a
 rtist and her Asheville band. With a $10 cover charge at the door\, don’
 t miss your chance to see Meschiya Lake live.\n\n\n\nNewly based in Ashevi
 lle\, Meschiya Lake's journey began at age nine in South Dakota and took h
 er from circus stages to the vibrant streets of New Orleans. Her powerful 
 voice and dynamic performances have garnered accolades\, including Female 
 Performer of the Year at the Big Easy Awards and recognition from NPR.\n\n
 \n\nHaving toured globally\, from Lincoln Center to stages across Europe a
 nd beyond\, Meschiya Lake brings her unique blend of jazz and soul to Ashe
 ville. Join us at Jack of the Wood on August 24th for an evening of timele
 ss melodies and captivating performances. Mark your calendars for a night 
 of music that will leave you inspired after an evening of dancing to New O
 rleans sounds!\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/okunHhYf1L4\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://ww
 w.youtube.com/watch?v=1eexNOIO9CI\n\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/08/09-18-26_MeschiyaLakeMoodSwingers_IG_1080x1440.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Jack of the Wood
UID:12060@jackofthewood.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260919T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260919T180000
DTSTAMP:20260718T212955Z
URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/nobodys-darling-string-band-3-2026-09
 -05-2026-09-12-2026-09-19/
SUMMARY:NOBODY'S DARLING STRING BAND
DESCRIPTION:\nNobody’s Darling String Band plays lively music in the old-
 time tradition at Jack of the Wood Pub every Saturday afternoon from 4-6pm
 .\n\n\n\nBand Members include Dona Cavanagh\, fiddle\; Zena Rubin\, banjo-
 uke\; Maxine Herring\, rhythm guitar\; Hilary Dirlam\, melody guitar\; and
  Celia Millington-Wyckoff\, bass.\n\n\n\nThe five women comprising Nobody
 ’s Darling each have a long history of playing old-time music. Individua
 lly they have played in many other bands through the years\, including The
  Carolina Oldtimers\, The Pegtwisters\, The Zuma House Band\, Too Hot To C
 ook\, The Luke Smathers Mountain Swing Band\, Honey Holler\, and The Carol
 ina Chick Peas.\n\n\n\nStop in to enjoy the music and an afternoon libatio
 n or two\, perhaps with an early supper or light bite . . . and don't forg
 et your dancing shoes!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nView this post on Instagra
 m\n\n\n\nA post shared by Uncle Paul (@unclepaul.music)\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps:/
 /youtu.be/kkkFP4I_sss?si=gzGWPrV77QLh1-Bg\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 5/11/JOTW_SAT-NobodysDarling_2025_IG_1080x1350.jpg
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Jack of the Wood
UID:12002@jackofthewood.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260919T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260919T233000
DTSTAMP:20260824T210832Z
URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/the-old-chevrolette-set-7/
SUMMARY:The Old Chevrolette Set
DESCRIPTION:\nThe Old Chevrolette Set performs old-school country duets wit
 h tunes you can two-step to! With vocal harmonies swimming in pedal steel 
 — and classic music from World War II to Watergate —&nbsp\;this ain't 
 no jet-set band!\n\n\n\nDavid Zoll and Laura Blackley provide vocals &amp\
 ; play guitars à la George &amp\; Tammy\, Gram &amp\; Emmylou\, and Loret
 ta &amp\; Conway. Tom Pittman (host of WNCW’s Country Gold) plays pedal 
 steel. The band is rounded out by a solid rhythm section comprised of Cary
  Fridley on bass and Dave Perkins on drums. \n\n\n\nWhen you take a ride w
 ith the Chevrolette\, it's always a good time! And George &amp\; Tammy wou
 ld love it!Music 8:30-11:30pm $10 cover at the door.\n\n\n\n\nhttps://yout
 u.be/Fjjz9qOacCo\n\n\n\n\n\nhttps://youtu.be/PbLsnvXdowQ\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
 \n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/08/09-19-26_OldChevroletteSet_IG_1080x1440-2.jpg
END:VEVENT
