URL:https://jackofthewood.com/events/9-25-dolly-day-angel-when-she-flies/
SUMMARY:9-25: Dolly Day
DESCRIPTION:\nWe’ve invited some of our favorite musicians to come togeth
 er for “ANGEL WHEN SHE FLIES: CELEBRATING THE HEART OF APPALACHIA”\, a
  tribute in song honoring THE QUEEN OF COUNTRY MUSIC hosted by honky-tonk 
 angel ALISSA NORDMOE and her RODEO — with very special guests ASHLEY HEA
 TH\, BEN BALMER\, CYNTHIA GALLI &amp\; SCOTT MURRAY\, LAUREL LEE\, REGGIE 
 HEADEN\, and VADEN LANDERS!\n\n\n\nWe’ll also be raising funds for Dolly
  Parton’s Imagination Library!\n\n\n\n\n
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jackofthewood.com/wp-content/uploads/202
 6/09/09-25-26_DollyPartonTribute_IG_1080x1440_ANNCMNT.jpg
END:VEVENT
